WEBVTT

00:00:00.300 --> 00:00:04.641
Here is how to keep your shop's records on WhatsApp, with TradePal Africa.

00:00:04.641 --> 00:00:06.577
It takes about a minute to learn.

00:00:07.777 --> 00:00:08.317
Step one.

00:00:08.317 --> 00:00:09.637
Say hello on WhatsApp.

00:00:09.637 --> 00:00:14.676
TradePal asks for your shop's name, and works out your country and currency for you.

00:00:16.935 --> 00:00:17.598
Step two.

00:00:17.598 --> 00:00:21.428
Write down what happens, just like texting a friend.

00:00:21.428 --> 00:00:22.090
No forms.

00:00:22.090 --> 00:00:23.416
No app to install.

00:00:27.031 --> 00:00:27.790
Step three.

00:00:27.790 --> 00:00:34.139
At the end of the day, send /today, to see your sales, your expenses, and what came in.

00:00:35.339 --> 00:00:36.421
Selling on credit?

00:00:36.421 --> 00:00:38.586
Use /debt to note who owes you.

00:00:38.586 --> 00:00:40.089
Slash paid when they pay.

00:00:40.089 --> 00:00:43.155
And /debts to see everyone who still owes you.

00:00:48.749 --> 00:00:49.438
Step four.

00:00:49.438 --> 00:00:50.471
Made a mistake?

00:00:50.471 --> 00:00:53.778
Send /undo, and the last entry is reversed.

00:00:53.778 --> 00:00:55.706
Nothing is silently deleted.

00:00:58.157 --> 00:01:01.602
Send /help any time to see what else you can do.

00:01:01.602 --> 00:01:04.917
Start free on WhatsApp, at tradepalafrica.com.
